    "label": "传递函数为 G(s)=1/(s(s+1)) 的直流电动机超前校正设计。性能指标：单位斜坡输入下的稳态误差 < 0.1，超调量 Mp < 25%。结果：K=10，超前校正装置 KDc(s)=10*(s/2+1)/(s/10+1)，得到相位裕度 PM=53°。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "Design of lead compensation for a DC motor with transfer function G(s)=1/(s(s+1)). Specifications: steady-state error < 0.1 for unit-ramp input, overshoot Mp < 25%. Result: K=10, lead compensator KDc(s)=10*(s/2+1)/(s/10+1), yielding PM=53°.",
